  dialogueTurnsList:
  - <Character>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 38ddbbfcad0297a45a2ef8fb84189c0e, type: 2}
    dialogueLine: "You\u2019ve escaped the abyss... that alone makes you stronger
      than most. But don\u2019t be fooled. This forest may let you pass, perhaps
      even shield you for a while. The city will not."
  - <Character>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 38ddbbfcad0297a45a2ef8fb84189c0e, type: 2}
    dialogueLine: Everything waits there everything watches. What poisons Averon
      does not hide... it rules. And you, bearer of pain, have yet to see its true
      face.
